# A general .gitignore file for various programming languages and frameworks.
# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.
# See https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore for a custom .gitignore file.

**/.artifacts/data/
**/.docker/data/

**/.cache/
**/.cache-*/
**/.direnv/*
**/.temp/
**/.tmp/

### Configuration Files
**/.config/*.config.*

!**/default.config.
!**/example.config.*

### dotenv
**/*.env
**/*.env.*

!**/example.env.*
!**/*.env.example
!**/*.env.default

### JetBrains IntelliJ
**/.idea/

*.iml
*.iws

### Visual Studio Code
**/.vscode/*

!**/.vscode/settings.json

### Windows (WSL2)
*:Zone.Identifier

### File Extensions
*.csv
*.csv.*

*.db
*.db.*
*.db-*.*

*.log
*.log.*

*-log.*

*.sqlite

*.zip
*.zip.*

## Language Specific

### Rust
**/debug/
**/target/

*.bk
*.bk.*

!**/Cargo.lock

### NodeJS
**/build/
**/debug/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/

**/*-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*

### Python
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/venv/

**/*.egg
**/*.egg.*

**/*.egg-info

**/*.pyc
**/*.pyc.*

**/*.pyo
**/*.pyo.*

**/*.pyz
**/*.pyz.*

**/*.pyzw
**/*.pyzw.*

**/*.whl
**/*.whl.*

## Frameworks

### Next.js
**/.next/
**/.vercel/

### SvelteKit / Sapper
**/__sapper__/
**/.DS_STORE/
**/.svelte-kit/
